DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T170000
SUMMARY:A Ghost in Your Ear
LOCATION:Audible's Minetta Lane Theatre\, Greenwich Village
DESCRIPTION:When an actor arrives late to a sound studio for a last-minute 
 
audiobook recording session\, he is handed the script of a chilling ghost s
 
tory to read. But as the engineer cues the recording and the evening wears 
 
on\, the horrors slowly begin to escape the page to haunt the studio itself
 
. Fresh from an acclaimed\, sold-out run in London\, A GHOST IN YOUR EAR is
 
 the "truly terrifying headphone horror" (The Guardian) from the darkly bri
 
lliant mind of Tony Award® nominee Jamie Armitage (SIX)\, made in collabor
 
ation with Ben and Max Ringham (ANNA\, National Theatre). A mesmerizing ble
 
nd of gothic horror and psychological thriller\, this cutting-edge theatric
 
al experience uses groundbreaking binaural sound technology to immerse ever
 
y audience member in a haunting world of sound. And at Audible's Minetta La
 
ne Theatre - one of New York's most intimate venues - there's no escaping t
 
he frights. Enter if you dare. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com
 
/a-ghost-in-your-ear-new-york-new-york-11-08-2026/event/300064F5DFB7A35B
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/a-ghost-in-your-ear-new-york-new-york-11-0
 
8-2026/event/300064F5DFB7A35B
END:VEVENT
